<title>UK: Stakis appoints new head for casino division.</title>
<headline>Stakis appoints new head for casino division.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish-based leisure group Stakis Plc said it had appointed Ian Payne as managing director of Stakis Casinos who will be joining from Bass Plc .</p>
<p>Payne would also be an executive director of the group. The exact date of his appointment has not been fixed.</p>
<p>In his current job Payne has been the managing director of Gala Clubs, a division of Bass Leisure Ltd.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
